Subject: [PATCH 8/9] fix(syntax): keep lambda colons out of type annotations
 (#3)

Keep lambda body separators separate from def-only type annotations so
existing lambda syntax remains valid when annotation parsing is enabled.

Fail-first grammar regressions, canonical tests, consumer coverage checks,
and independent final-head review validate the focused parser change.

Squashed from:
- 95e88d2ebcb432239d94088665fcd016bf30faf9
